    <text><table><thead><tr><th>System</th><th>Result</th><th>Finding</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Neurological</td><td>Positive</td><td>One seizure in week three of the titration; no dizziness, double vision, or unsteadiness</td></tr><tr><td>Integumentary</td><td>Negative</td><td>No rash or mouth sores</td></tr><tr><td>Psychiatric</td><td>Negative</td><td>Mood better; fewer urges; no thoughts of suicide or self-harm</td></tr></tbody></table><paragraph>3 systems reviewed. [S]</paragraph></text>

  </section>
</component>

